// Title: Rundll32 Execution Without CommandLine Parameters
// Rule ID: 1775e15e-b61b-4d14-a1a3-80981298085a
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1202
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
